docs {
  # Update Project Status
  
  Updates the status of an existing project. Invalidates the projects cache on success.
  
  ## Authorization
  
  - **Authentication:** Required — Bearer token via `authenticate()`.
  - **Permission:** `read` — enforced by `authorize("read")`.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description                     |
  |-----------|------|----------|---------------------------------|
  | `id`      | uuid | ✅       | The ID of the project to update.|
  
  ### Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Validation                          |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------|
  | `status`  | string | ✅       | Must be `"ongoing"` or `"completed"`. Empty strings are rejected. |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the updated project record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "title": "Project Title",
      "description": "Project description text",
      "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
      "imagePublicId": "public_id_string",
      "status": "completed",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-05T00:00:00.000Z"
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Cache Invalidation
  
  - **Deleted Key:** `cedarrise:dashboard:projects`
  - The projects list cache is cleared after a successful status update.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                          |
  |-----------------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid ID format or invalid status value.           |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid Bearer token.                     |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Insufficient permissions.                            |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                             |
}
